  "description": "After finally escaping her unhappy marriage, Lorella is ready to enjoy a single life. Marriage certificate burned? Check. A gentle, handsome knight willing to help her in any way? Check. Everything seems to be going smoothly until a message suddenly appears before her eyes. “Dear Lorella Mayred, congratulations on becoming a heroine candidate!” If she fails to become the final heroine, she’ll be wiped from existence and the memories of everyone who knows her. Will Lorella be able to surpass her rivals and become the heroine of this world, all while being caught up in a love triangle? \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
